# Worms of the Earth's "If a player does either, destroy this enchantment": a player who has it deal 5 damage to them has
# done so even if the damage is prevented (Vexing Devil's 2012-05-01 ruling for the same wording). Bot2 plays a Plains and
# casts Circle of Protection: Black on turn 2, before the Worms is out; Bot1 casts the Worms on turn 3. At Bot2's upkeep on
# turn 4 Bot2 activates the Circle off its Mox Jet, choosing the Worms, a black source, then chooses the 5 damage first
# (CR 101.4), and Bot1 neither: the damage is prevented (CR 615.1), and the Worms is destroyed all the same (CR 701.8a).

